{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39681","headline":"寄怀南北故人 · 黄滔","name":"寄怀南北故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风昨夜落芙蕖，一片离心到外区。\n南海浪高书堕水，北州城破客降胡。\n玉窗挑凤佳人老，绮陌啼莺碧树枯。\n岭上青风陇头月，时通魂梦出来无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}